    "launch_check_note": "Verified 2026-10-22: en_CA and fr_CA /supercharger-for-business/get/overview return 200 (Canada newly launched). LV, TR, AE and LI still 404 on that path. AE (ar_AE, en_AE) and TR (tr_TR) now serve a localized /supercharger-for-business info page with no link to the configurator; SA, QA and JO do too, but their API pricing still returns 500. The 27 other launched non-US landing pages all link to the configurator. Verified 2026-10-01: all 28 launched localized /supercharger-for-business/get/overview pages still return 200; LV, TR, AE and LI still 404. Unchanged since 2026-08-01. Verified 2026-08-01: each localized /supercharger-for-business/get/overview returned 200 with no redirect and real configurator markup (the Polish page renders the localized title 'Supercharger dla firm | Tesla'). LV, TR, AE and LI still 404.",
